OL,3,GNEWSAMum says teenage autistic son has
OL,4,Abeen abandoned and falling through
OL,5,Acracks in system
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mother has said she feels her son has
OL,8,Fbeen "abandoned and is falling through
OL,9,Fcracks in the system" because of a lack
OL,10,Fof support for young adults with
OL,11,Flearning difficulties.
OL,13,FCherisse Lanigan's son Callan has
OL,14,Fautism and Attention Deficit
OL,15,FHyperactivity Disorder (ADHD), as well
OL,16,Fas anxiety and other behavioural
OL,17,Fissues.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
