OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum says teenage autistic son has
OL,4,Abeen abandoned and falling through
OL,5,Acracks in system
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe recently turned 18 but cannot access
OL,8,Fadult disability services because of
OL,9,Fthe way health trusts assess support
OL,10,Fneeds using an IQ test. Cherisse
OL,11,Fbelieves it is a flawed system that is
OL,12,Fdisadvantaging her son.
OL,14,FThe Northern Health Trust has said it
OL,15,Frecognises the approach "can present
OL,16,Fsignificant challenges" for individuals
OL,17,Fand families who do not meet the
OL,18,Feligibility criteria.
